WEBVTT

NOTE A morning. Where we’re taking it. Imagery, film and voices made with AI.

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.200
[A single drop on still water]

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.000
[A kettle begins to tick]

3
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.600
<v Anthrie>Morning. Priya’s waiting on your go-ahead for the pilot.

4
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.100
<v Anthrie>I’ve drafted a yes. Send it?

5
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.400
<v You>Yes.

6
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.700
<v Anthrie>Sent.

7
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.100
<v Anthrie>Rahul moved your call to eleven. You’re free till then.

8
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.000
[Keys, then the front door opens]

9
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.000
<v Anthrie>Nothing else needs you this morning.

10
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.000
[Birdsong, and quiet music]

11
00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.000
[A drop, and one ring]

12
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
A chief of staff for every human. Where we’re taking it.
